### Register
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{username}}", "email": "nicoline@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login (saves the token in a variable)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{username}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Route overview (admin only)
GET {{host}}/routes
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public endpoint, no token needed
GET {{host}}/cocktails/1
